OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 61, in court charged with
OL,4,Amurder of 'stabbed' woman who died
OL,5,Aafter crash
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 61-year-old man has appeared in court
OL,8,Fcharged with the murder of a woman who
OL,9,Fsuffered "stab wounds" and died
OL,10,Ffollowing a crash.
OL,12,FEleanor Barnfield, 47, died in hospital
OL,13,Fafter police were called to a crash on
OL,14,FCoity Road in Bridgend on Monday, where
OL,15,Fthey found she had "puncture wounds
OL,16,Funrelated to the collision". The BBC
OL,17,Funderstands they were sustained in a
OL,18,Fstabbing.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
