OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 61, in court charged with
OL,4,Amurder of 'stabbed' woman who died
OL,5,Aafter crash
OL,6,
OL,7,FClifford Foster was arrested on Tuesday
OL,8,Fat the Ger-y-Nant retirement housing
OL,9,Fcomplex, close to where the crash
OL,10,Fhappened, where he lived and Eleanor
OL,11,Fworked.
OL,13,FSpeaking only to confirm his name, age
OL,14,Fand address, Foster appeared at Newport
OL,15,FMagistrates' Court on Friday, wearing a
OL,16,Fgrey tracksuit and using a crutch to
OL,17,Fsupport himself.
